  examples:
  - id: msg-01-wrong-note
    text: Don't trust the note in the top drawer. It's lying to you.
    isMisleading: 1
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
  - id: msg-02-key-under-plant
    text: The silver key is under the potted plant in the corner. Check again, you missed it.
    isMisleading: 0
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: plant-drawer
  - id: msg-03-red-crate-wrong
    text: I saw someone move the red crate to the left slot. That's wrong, put it right.
    isMisleading: 1
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: slot-red-left
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
  - id: msg-04-mirror-truth
    text: The mirror shows the truth, but only when the lights are off. Look at the reflection.
    isMisleading: 0
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
  - id: msg-05-blue-book
    text: Blue book goes in the top drawer, not bottom. Trust me.
    isMisleading: 1
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: slot-blue-bottom
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
  - id: msg-06-toolbox-key
    text: Toolbox needs the rusty silver key, not the gold one. Gold is for the desk.
    isMisleading: 0
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
  - id: msg-07-code
    text: He said code is 3-1-4, but I swear it's 1-4-3. Don't listen to him.
    isMisleading: 1
    triggerOnWrongSlotId: 
    triggerOnCorrectSlotId: 
    triggerOnDrawerId: 
